{
  "_comment": "Colours are DESIGN.md tokens converted to sRGB hex, not new colours. theme_color #00876e is --color-accent oklch(0.55 0.12 175); background_color #f7fbfa is --color-bg oklch(0.985 0.004 175). Hex rather than oklch because a manifest is read by the OS as often as by the browser, and CSS Color 4 support there is uneven — an unparseable colour becomes no colour at all.",
